                <pb facs="0013" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4 Steering Committee/502: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bern</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-01-26T18:00:00+01:00">January 26, 1937—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 26—2 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>11. In this afternoon’s session the Council fixed May 6th for the meeting of the
                    Bureau of the Disarmament Conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
